Description: Bridges push notifications from ofono to telepathy-ofono
 This component registers a push agent with ofono and handles the MMS workflow
 by bridging with telepathy-ofono.

Package: nuntium-tools
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Built-Using:
 ${misc:Built-Using},
Description: Useful tools for working with MMS and nuntium
 This package contains command-line tools for working with MMS that can:
  - Decode m-retrieve.conf messages
  - Stub an ofono push notification into nuntium

Package: golang-gitlab-ubports-development-core-nuntium-dev
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: golang
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Go library for manipulating MMS, interfacing with oFono and Telepathy-oFono
 This package handles MMS PDUs and has hooks for related actions in the MMS
 workflow. It also provides facilities to interface with oFono and
 Telepathy-oFono with regards to MMS through DBus.
